1272..1345 Comment "/// The law below a second restriction, sending on the outer channel: the"
1346..1423 Comment "/// occurrence counts past one abstraction to its binder and the law\'s counts"
1424..1500 Comment "/// past none, so the law does not apply; the normal form names each atom by"
1501..1515 Comment "/// its depth."
